CaptionStew-CLAP

This repository includes code adapted from the following projects:

1) Auden (https://github.com/AudenAI/Auden) - Apache License 2.0
   - captionstew_clap/zipformer/*: Zipformer encoder modules, vendored from
     auden/models/zipformer (import paths changed; k2 made optional).
   - The CLAP model structure, caption preprocessing and retrieval metrics follow
     the Auden CLAP implementation used to train the released checkpoints.

2) k2-fsa/icefall (https://github.com/k2-fsa/icefall) - Apache License 2.0
   Copyright 2021-2023 Xiaomi Corp.
   - Zipformer architecture and scaling modules (via Auden).
   - Checkpoint averaging logic in scripts/convert_checkpoint.py.

3) Lhotse (https://github.com/lhotse-speech/lhotse) - Apache License 2.0
   - captionstew_clap/features.py re-implements Lhotse's Kaldi-compatible Fbank.

The above projects retain their respective copyrights.
